<title>PANAMA: SOCCER-CUBA BEAT PANAMA 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CUBA BEAT PANAMA 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PANAMA CITY 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cuba beat Panama 3-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a CONCACAF World Cup semifinal round group</p>
<p>two qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cuba - Eduardo Cebranco (42nd and 73rd minutes), Manuel</p>
<p>Bobadillo (88th)</p>
<p>Panama - Jorge Dely Valdez (55th)</p>
<p>Attendanced: 10,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for goals against, points)</p>
<p> El Salvador	 1  1  0  0  5  0  3</p>
<p> Canada		1  1  0  0  3  1  3</p>
<p> Cuba		  1  1  0  0  3  6  3</p>
<p> Panama		1  0  0  2  2  6  0</p>
<p>Top two teams go into the final CONCACAF qualifying round.</p>
</text>
